Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Refresh Zombie Survival: horde nights and heat

Every seventh night the dead come in waves wherever the player is, and
noise heats an area until scouts come to see what it was. The game's
clock panel counts down to the next horde.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
